{% import '_includes/forms' as forms %}

<p class="light">
    {{ 'This gateway spends the balance Boomerang’s wallet holds for the signed-in customer. It offers itself only when there is a balance to spend, so it is safe to leave enabled for everyone.'|t('boomerang') }}
</p>

<p class="light">
    {{ 'Set the payment type to **Purchase** unless your other gateways authorize and capture — the wallet does both, and it should behave like the rest of your checkout rather than differently.'|t('boomerang')|md }}
</p>

{% if not plugin.isPro %}
    <p class="warning">{{ 'Store credit needs Boomerang Pro. The gateway stays configured and existing payments stay refundable, but nobody can pay with it.'|t('boomerang') }}</p>
{% endif %}
